{"duration_api_ms":63922,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"bb0c1a71-cfa8-4794-9135-959539a77f7f","total_cost_usd":0.5078154,"usage":{"input_tokens":34,"cache_creation_input_tokens":36124,"cache_read_input_tokens":565237,"output_tokens":5282,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1265},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":36124,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":41559,"cache_creation_input_tokens":545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":545},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":34,"outputTokens":5282,"cacheReadInputTokens":565237,"cacheCreationInputTokens":36124,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5078154,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1265,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01LJboRxC8F7ucxpb6bbHfSM","tool_input":{"command":"cat src/test-e2e/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/e2e/BaseE2ETest.java | head -80; lsof -iTCP:8080 -sTCP:LISTEN; curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' http://localhost:8080/products; grep -n \"e2e\\|browser\" .agents/factory/factory.profile.yaml","description":"Inspect e2e base class, port 8080 and profile"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01USLmRGPW9ojSL8CREeRzAX","tool_input":{"command":"curl -s -m 5 -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' http://localhost:8080/products","description":"Check whether a shop answers on port 8080"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01FySucFTtAfvQG3KWBph6HV","tool_input":{"command":"java -jar build/libs/dca-ecommerce-sample-java-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar --server.port=18080 > /tmp/cat02-shop.log 2>&1","description":"Start this checkout's shop on port 18080","run_in_background":true}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01XwgFk7FW7Hd7jSnu8pY8aK","tool_input":{"command":"java -jar build/libs/dca-ecommerce-sample-java-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar --server.port=18080","description":"Start this checkout's shop on port 18080","run_in_background":true}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":20,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The gate refusal isn't fixed, and I don't think it can be fixed in the test code. The only failing check is `tests-green` for `ProductPageE2ETest#viewDetailsOpensTheProductsPageHeadedWithItsName`, and the problem is the environment it runs in.\n\n**Why it fails:**\n- The `test-e2e` task doesn't start the app. It runs against whatever answers on `http://localhost:8080` (see `gradle/plugins/test-e2e.gradle`, \"requires running application\").\n- The test times out while opening `/products`, waiting for `[data-test='product-card']`. None of the test's own steps or assertions run.\n- The existing, unchanged `SeededCatalogE2ETest` fails at exactly the same wait when run the same way. So whatever is on :8080 is not this checkout's shop with its seeded products.\n\n**What I changed:** only `tasks/CAT-02/tests.md`. I added a note under `## Notes` with this diagnosis. I didn't touch any test or production code, because changing one to get past an environment problem would weaken the test.\n\n**Not done:** I tried to start this checkout's jar on port 18080 to see the test pass, but that command needed your approval and wasn't run. So the e2e test is still not seen green.\n\n**To get past the gate:** stop whatever is on :8080, start this checkout's shop there with `./gradlew bootRun`, then run the gate again:\n```\npython3 .agents/factory/story-gate.py --story CAT-02 --stage test\n```\nIf you'd rather the pipeline start the shop itself before `test-e2e`, that's a stack decision for `tech.md` or the profile, not part of this story.","ttft_ms":2190,"type":"result","duration_ms":133227,"uuid":"592ea768-f710-4150-9268-29b45529ae52","ttft_stream_ms":1632,"time_to_request_ms":95,"first_content_frame_ms":1632,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
